---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_supplied: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert: revert Paused
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_settled: tokens have been supplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_settled --> q_verify_alloc_sig: position.hasSettled == false
    q_check_settled --> q_revert: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_verify_alloc_sig --> q_verify_vesting_sig: allocation signature valid
    q_verify_alloc_sig --> q_revert: revert InvalidAllocationSignature
    q_verify_vesting_sig --> q_calc_tokens: vesting terms signature valid
    q_verify_vesting_sig --> q_revert: revert InvalidVestingSignature
    q_calc_tokens --> q_check_vesting: calculate tokens from investedCapital and tokenAllocationRate
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vesting schedule required
    q_check_vesting --> q_direct_transfer: immediate distribution
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_to_vesting: deploy vesting contract via EIP-1167 clone
    q_transfer_to_vesting --> q_mark_settled: transfer tokens to vesting contract
    q_direct_transfer --> q_mark_settled: transfer tokens to investor
    q_mark_settled --> [*]: position.hasSettled = true, emit TokensClaimed
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_verify_alloc_sig
        INV-001: dual signature verification required (allocation + vesting)
        INV-002: allocation signature encodes token amount
        INV-003: vesting signature encodes schedule parameters
    end note

    note right of q_calc_tokens
        INV-004: tokens = investedCapital * tokenAllocationRate / 1e18
        INV-005: used signatures marked to prevent replay
    end note
